## 2. Third-party material — NOT covered by the licence above

The licence in section 1 applies **only** to material originally authored for
this repository. It does not apply to any third-party material, which remains
the property of its respective owners.

**Source letters.** *The AI Engineering Skills Map* and the letters it is drawn
from, published by DeepLearning.AI, are © DeepLearning.AI. This repository
paraphrases them, quotes at most one or two sentences per letter, and links to
each original letter. It does not reproduce them in full, in English or in
translation. Every quotation is attributed in place and the letters are listed
in [`docs/MAP.md`](docs/MAP.md). **No licence over that material is granted
here, and no rights in it are claimed.**

**Academic papers, official documentation and practitioner articles.** Every
work cited in this repository remains under its own licence. Where such a work is
briefly quoted, the quotation serves commentary and study, and does not affect
the status of the underlying work.

If you reuse any part of this repository, separating the original content from
the third-party material inside it is your responsibility.

